written negated as `w`-bit two's complement words: entry `ℓ` is
`(2^w − tableD ℓ) mod 2^w`, from `expPos` on `α² bb(ℓ)²` over `s²` shifted
down by `2α²` bits, and every halving word is `(2^w − 2^(p−1)) mod 2^w`. The
powers `2^(4p)`, `2^(2α²)`, `2^w`, `2^(p−1)` come from doubling loops.
Generated by `tabdgen.py`. -/

